---
description: Fake backend data at the api/ layer to test a product hypothesis without the real backend.
globs: ["src/**/api/**/*.{ts,tsx}"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `docs/vibe/mock-data.md`. When a hypothesis needs the internal app
backend (`apiHttpClient`), return typed mock data from the slice's
`api/services.ts` behind the `USE_MOCKS` toggle (`src/shared/config/mocks.ts`) —
never mock inside components or stores. Name mock files `<name>.mock.ts`, match
the real response type, and keep the real backend call in the `else` branch.
